    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλευ-άζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλεύη</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jest, scoff,</i>
			
